Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini
CONTINUE.md
/HANDOFF.md
/PLANTREE.md

# Local backups
*.bak.*

# Internal review notes
SELF_REVIEW.md

# AGENTS.md/CLAUDE.md live one level up at the umbrella-directory level and
# are ignored here; committing an agent instruction file is the documented
# exception. ADRs and other internal engineering docs live in a
# private companion repository, not tracked here.
/AGENTS.md
/CLAUDE.md
